+  strlen2, GCC16 returned0. Both AST and post-inline literal evaluators now stop
+  at the first NUL; a permanent runtime gate passes. The separate static
+  initializer panic remains unaddressed and requires its own scope.
+- Fresh gzip1.14 archive digest verified; configured deflate.c compiled with
+  LCCC/GCC16 under -O2. longest_match stack-address memory-instruction screen:
+  **LCCC28, GCC16 10** (LEAs excluded). The earlier session LCCC result was28;
