+because a scalar GEP acquired a pointer recurrence. Reproducer:
+`tests/benchmark/programs/nbody.c`, `-O2 -march=x86-64-v3`,
+`LCCC_DUMP_IR=1 CCC_IVSR_DEBUG=1` (both dumps go to stderr).
