+Oracle targets: `sha256_transform ≤ 1.5×`, epilogue ref-count −50 %.
+Design refs: [`engineering/DECISIONS.md`](engineering/DECISIONS.md)
+RA-GLA-01/02/03. Aligns with **R3** (RA span supply + phi/ORI lowering —
